  "rows: cred_s10.load_rows over train/val/test restricted to the 159 PMIDs of data/CRED/cv/fold*.txt; y = label == '1'; unreachable rows score 0 (strict) whatever an arm file says",
  "an arm file is either per-row scores {pmid, gene_id, disease_id, score} or raw biocausal.score rows (per pair p_pc(1) if probs_pc is present, else p(Pos)+p(Neg)); several files average per key (seed ensemble), then a row takes the max over its candidate pairs",
  "dropped = a reachable row without a score, or a non-uniform number of files per key (e.g. 14 of 15 OOF files)",
  "C = same_sent: the CRED authors' flag, zeroed on unreachable rows (strict); same_sent_raw keeps the flag there",
  "document bootstrap: one resample = a multiset of the 159 PMIDs; all arms share the resamples (paired)"
